{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:f00507eac4753788","name":"Hush-About Personal Jet Pack","source":{"id":"source:reference-f00507eac4753788","title":"Hush-About Personal Jet Pack","revision":19463,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:01:29Z","sha256":"1283fd7f8e375bd2a5b0fa73a936284e4f51ba2211e3b34a4eb0e3389a0337aa","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19463","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Hush-About%20Personal%20Jet%20Pack&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-f00507eac4753788","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 3,750\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 30 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A light ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jet Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jet_Pack","referenceId":"reference:a59ece57b04d9594"}," that is engineered to produce little to no noise, Arakyd's Hush-About Personal Jet Pack is often used by covert enemies of the Empire who are engaged in sabotage and espionage missions. A Hush-About Jet Pack uses a small jet engine that produces little noise beyond a high-pitch whine, meaning that the wearer takes no penalty on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks because of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," when using the Hush-About Jet Pack (allowing the wearer to double ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move","referenceId":"reference:6ecc3df6bffdd06c"}," or take the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Run"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Run","referenceId":"reference:00d60e31a4e6b834"}," Action while flying the Hush-About Jet Pack with no penalty on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["An Arakyd Hush-About Personal Jet Pack functions in all other ways like a normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jet Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jet_Pack","referenceId":"reference:a59ece57b04d9594"},", though each fuel cell for the Hush-About Jet Pack carries only 6 charges instead of the normal 10. Replacement fuel cells cost 100 credits.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
